# License

## The short, human version 🎉

Do whatever you want with this. Seriously.

Copy it. Change it. Break it. Rebuild it at 2am because you thought you could improve the flexbox. Translate it. Print it out. Teach from it. Use it as a coaster if you insist. 🍕

Just keep the name of the class on it and do not pretend you wrote it. That is the whole deal.

